Four runs of measure.py on each of commit 951556c (before, origin/main) and a26af1e (after, this branch),
alternating before and after, each tree's src first on PYTHONPATH. Load average (1, 5, 15 min) 4.57 5.19 4.55 at the start and 2.68 3.85 4.14 at the end,
from other jobs on the 4 logical cores (/proc/loadavg). The runs, in order, then the medians over them (summarize.py).

